{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "906f0c15fb531a904330c7d563758e5bc8ca17dfe7045b9beb90206afd180124", "ja": "完成した『ハピマリ』に、盛り上がる一同。\nしかし風花の両親は、そのCMを見てから\nいつ結婚するのかと騒いでるらしい。トップ\nアイドルにする責任を果たすために、プロ\nデューサーは説得に行くと、皆に誓った。", "zh": "众人看着完成的『幸福婚礼』开始热烈讨论。\n不过风花的父母自从看了那支广告后，\n似乎就开始逼问她何时才要结婚。\n为了履行让大家成为顶尖偶像的责任，\n制作人向大家发誓会去说服风花的父母。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1000_039kon", "source_sha256": "fb13b752d89132106ce7bfc15c3c446c61526c38eae3e0c5d6d4172b0cf29197", "ja": "みんなー！　お待ちかねのアレを持ってきたわよ！", "zh": "各位～！我把大家期待已久的那个带来啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "d58fd0f244779507520272490830075e0f66abfb055121ee245813053caacd92", "ja": "お待ちかねのアレって、もしかして……！\n美顔ローラーかしら！？　それとも、ヨガマット？", "zh": "期待已久的那个，该不会是……！\n美颜滚轮吗！？还是瑜伽垫？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "a953e2168903232e8e85b858f971b601a5b59382453b82a10eeea7b16d233aa8", "ja": "どっちも違うわよ！　持ってきたのは『ハピマリ』！\n届いたら、みんなで見ようって言ってたでしょ！", "zh": "都不是！我带来的是『幸福婚礼』！\n不是说了寄来之后要大家一起看吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1003_se", "source_sha256": "bd34885ea88304341e34c7569792965841d74a52031f41180dc607a6b6f842d2", "ja": "ドサッ！", "zh": "（咚！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "ba80f2603e1550c74b494a62470a86ef50c866dc87a9480bdc416c77f5160a56", "ja": "わぁ、ずっと楽しみにしていました♪\nそれにしても……本当に、すごいボリューム……！", "zh": "哇～我期待好久了♪\n不过话说回来……真的好厚……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "d8561af306223495d43d3c45564eb4f2601afe400ed12ffc9145ec8d6a9308e6", "ja": "そ、そうなんですの。何しろ重くって、\nまだ握力が戻りませんわ……。", "zh": "就、就是啊。\n实在太重了，本小姐的握力都还没恢复……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "f4b645aceac43179ca13c436ce77ee30fe86d22597862078bfc69e468034f99a", "ja": "ごめんね千鶴ちゃん。その重さこそ、結婚にかかる\n想いの重さなのかも知れないわね……。", "zh": "不好意思啦千鹤，不过这个重量，\n或许正是寄托在结婚上的意念之重呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "23913b0593301d5ceebe6f6517d006a967f414d20a97db82ef246b4690622caa", "ja": "なんて、そんなことはどうでもいいの。\nそれより、早くみんなで見ましょう♪", "zh": "随便讲讲的，这些不重要啦。\n大家快点一起来看吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "e4eefe457d86de673d8bccebb65fa1e2d12551ca2faff0fad0660bb958c9cf40", "ja": "風花のウェディングドレス姿、改めて見ても\n綺麗ですわね……。見とれてしまいますわ～。", "zh": "风花穿上婚纱的样子，再看一次还是很美呢……\n本小姐都要看得入迷了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "755f87ddf510874abf1328e687f29d5ce8f2174c09d144f8b939b20785861163", "ja": "そんな……。千鶴ちゃんの色打掛姿も、とっても\n鮮やかでゴージャスで！　はぁ～、素敵だなぁ～♪", "zh": "哪有……千鹤的色打挂打扮也很艳丽豪华！\n啊～真漂亮～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "c7e79d1f4a609555f1aab7289355969acefd318ecf4a3762686c469d08b1d22e", "ja": "ま、まあ、わたくしはセレブですもの、当然ですわ！\nおーっほっほっほっほ……、ゲホッゴホッ。", "zh": "对、对啊，毕竟本小姐是名流，这是当然了！\n哦～呵呵呵呵……咳咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "83a81ea8bd846096c5f138fa1698f3c8646f1edac6165ccfae5abd8792c1944a", "ja": "歌織ちゃんも素敵よね♪　私が親だったら、\n娘のこんな綺麗な花嫁姿見たら、泣いちゃうかも。", "zh": "歌织也很漂亮呢♪如果我是你父母，\n看到女儿这么美丽的新娘模样，可能会哭出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1012_052kao", "source_sha256": "1df5194ad97e17e052dbaac1e9dbedaae96f851fd8a9493cd950f876f7426d61", "ja": "それは嬉しいですけど……。\nやっぱり、父には見せない方がいいのかしら？", "zh": "听你这么说我是很高兴……\n但我还是先别给我父亲看比较好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "d35a430cbb3cab555237a7f82143a4b1fc140ebbd5c052fcf0feb4a19cde632f", "ja": "いいじゃない、泣かせちゃいましょうよ、お父さん！\n……あっ、私のグラビアも発見～♪", "zh": "有什么关系，就让令尊哭出来嘛！\n……啊，也看到我的写真照了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "a7d6d92a099a3449db02d005bd36be009481004371bc52f6bff3e8227b5f10a8", "ja": "我ながらいい出来よね～。\nこれ、私の新しい宣材写真にしてもらえないのかな？", "zh": "不是我自夸，拍得还真不错呢～\n不知道能不能把这张当作我的新宣传照？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "da1806f2debb8dac4699305ec57c738541696d157bca1bf088b4d8a92c730828", "ja": "斬新な宣材写真になりそうね……。", "zh": "感觉会变成很崭新的宣传照……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1016_null", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1017_p", "source_sha256": "cc832b1f20f0124aa516c577c2d0388f36e572221f39f5f8176d741d9c6dab56", "ja": "お疲れ様です。みんなで集まって何を……\nあ、『ハピマリ』の見本誌、届いてたんですね？", "zh": "辛苦了，大家聚在一起干嘛……\n啊，原来是『幸福婚礼』的样书寄到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "c477af1081dec76c31649809a80328e0aeeaa9dc6caeb0de7e2aa9f103f414a4", "ja": "フフ、ごめんなさい、先に見せてもらってるわ。\nそれで、前評判はどうなの、{$P$}？", "zh": "呵呵，不好意思，我们先看起来了。\n结果预告的评价怎么样，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1019_p", "source_sha256": "ec51ceea7f8d00d835cfc93dc1d1998cd2ce10adab96f23989c209022d08eab4", "ja": "はい。実はさっき、出版社から連絡があったんですが。\n……CM効果も抜群で、注文殺到中だそうです！", "zh": "其实刚才出版社有联络我们……\n听说广告效果非常好，涌入了大量订单！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "60a6fadcabeb1d7c6d565ab3fc86cb133ce062e760365ea980c0d4a7fdfc3baa", "ja": "ホント！？　やったじゃない！\nウフフ、みんなでがんばった甲斐があったわね！", "zh": "真的！？太棒了！\n呵呵，大家的努力获得回报了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "43c3b8a3a8d94631fd0be93524194e621a8c99972fee3ace8547c135254353e2", "ja": "{$P$}くんも大変だったでしょ？\nなにしろ、765プロのみんなが花嫁だったんだもの。", "zh": "{$P$}也很辛苦吧？\n毕竟765艺能的所有人都是新娘。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1022_p", "source_sha256": "5b5dc690a28234beebfe59778deda540e0b82325b2e2cba81b939fb49b1b2854", "ja": "確かに、いろいろ大変だったな。\nでも、みんな幸せそうで、なんだか……ほっとしたよ。", "zh": "的确是有不少辛苦的地方，不过看到大家\n都很幸福的样子，我有种……放心了的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1023_046rio", "source_sha256": "d5f4dd4b24bab201387ffebf0bed3f9339af87c2ce01c9c193b7798b6fa751ac", "ja": "あら、本当にお父さんみたいな台詞ね。\nこらこら、老けこむのはまだ早いぞ～っ♪", "zh": "哎呀，真的很像爸爸会说的话呢。\n喂喂喂，要装老成还太早啰～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "aaefaa72d8135f1e2537be5d8c5786d4edb96f901d3a17a0ad91daf79d7c8c90", "ja": "お父さんといえば……{$P$}さん？\nじつは相談というか、お願いがあるんですけど……。", "zh": "说到爸爸……{$P$}，\n其实我有件事想找你商量，或着该说请求……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "a4d14b5b7ac5706c12b66bad682c238081555529989aa5ae24f11df9eda9a79d", "ja": "ん？　どうしたんだ？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1026_041fuk", "source_sha256": "fedf4d946ff5be6d159aaccc8f6ffca48b296e76df6d68b46a26f70800690211", "ja": "あの、CMが流れたせいか……私の両親が、お前の\n結婚はどうなってるんだって、騒ぎ始めたんです～。", "zh": "那个，可能是广告播出的关系……\n我爸妈开始逼问我结婚的事情～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1027_p", "source_sha256": "2778e401c4c2db87d96f7ed9cc9992a687996bef4d0ee1a2cf9c951fb1549d39", "ja": "な、なるほど……。いきなり娘の花嫁姿を\n宣伝されまくってるわけだし、それも無理ないか……。", "zh": "原、原来如此……毕竟女儿的新娘模样\n突然被大肆宣传，也不能怪他们啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "f79cb675d4cece3593bc98e79eeb29b1e86c200a3a6053875809b1708aad805a", "ja": "よし、わかった！　ちょっとご挨拶がてら、\n風花と一緒に状況を説明しに行くよ。", "zh": "好，我明白了！我跟风花一起去解释情况，\n顺便拜访一下令尊令堂。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1029_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7ac12d26616fffb13a4235295cd3bc3972827279b1f0626f446dedd3b1f7d8ab", "ja": "え、いいんですか！？　はぁ、よかった。私の話は\nぜんぜん聞いてくれなくて……とっても助かります♪", "zh": "咦，可以吗！？啊～太好了。\n他们完全不肯听我说……真是得救了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1030_046rio", "source_sha256": "f86960fc142d5b15c0ddd3967d8e863fd4e249a232d8e8a8f38c95e083c2ea62", "ja": "女の子の両親を説得するっていうと～、\nもしかしてアレかしら！", "zh": "去说服女孩子的爸妈～\n该不会是那个吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1031_039kon", "source_sha256": "6ad62fcd9c6115bc9b24f43b7f2d021f12eaefbb746d676e57757d7520e52d01", "ja": "ええ、アレね！\nお義父さん、娘さんを、ボクに……！", "zh": "对啊，就是那个吧！\n岳父，请将令嫒许配给我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1032_p", "source_sha256": "63e44a05e61c3336c2a8660537151429745a7d98a8908c9ac38a8bb23a34b550", "ja": "このみさん、茶化さないでくださいね。\nだいたい莉緒が言ったんだろ？", "zh": "木实，不要开我玩笑啦。\n再说这是莉绪自己讲过的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1033_046rio", "source_sha256": "e821e91020b56e245169901a5a510ea46dbb95ae966d56f849da0348f31e3b75", "ja": "え、私が？\nえっと～……、なんだっけ？", "zh": "咦，我吗？\n呃……我讲了什么来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1034_p", "source_sha256": "bb817e383dfe20c2bad89d1bb3f0cefea5aa2c8aedeaf57f9122e800871d7d9c", "ja": "プロデューサーとして、責任とれって。\n……だから責任をとりに行くだけだよ。", "zh": "你叫我要负起身为制作人的责任。\n……所以我只是去履行职责而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1035_p", "source_sha256": "ace50488f27fc47e1ae54139b4b55a1eb6b7f5dd904d3943d8d415f571916b9e", "ja": "風花を、みんなを、トップアイドルにしてみせます！\n……って、ちゃんと言いに行こうかな、と。", "zh": "我会让风花和大家成为顶尖偶像的！\n……我在想要不要上门去讲这件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1041_046rio", "source_sha256": "afb97ba2b4ebd1b5fc23ffeb3ce63ebe753010497492912c128497284b8d6c5d", "ja": "そ、そういえば、そうだったわね……。\nうん、じゃあ、しっかり言って来てね！", "zh": "这、这么一说，好像也是喔……\n嗯，那你要去好好跟人家爸妈讲喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1042_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e21b8b395a5fd2642e3095db6c82826c61c7c51c57545e7fd0a01d7882f55e3a", "ja": "はい……あの、{$P$}さん。\n私たちのこと、これからも……よろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "是啊……那个，{$P$}先生！\n我们……以后也请你多多指教了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1043_p", "source_sha256": "2e6feadb37c076618670814620f2aeb60aca4e78ee65663296663fcc5befc2aa", "ja": "（アイドルはステージに恋をする。\nなら、プロデューサーは……）", "zh": "（偶像会爱上舞台。\n那么，制作人……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_07_1044_p", "source_sha256": "3d2cfc90a07b7cdad4ca2f86592b8efaccf65666f7a9f0bb03a459c40d2c896b", "ja": "（いや、プロデューサーは恋しないのかもしれない。\nただ、恋する者をプロデュースするだけだ！）", "zh": "（不，制作人或许不会恋爱，\n他要做的只是培育谈恋爱的人！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
